<article class="prose">
  <h2 class="page-title">Yeh jagah</h2>

  <p>Kuch lafz kahe nahi jaate, bas andar kahin zinda reh jaate hain.</p>

  <p>Yeh jagah unhi lafzon ka ghar hai — jo dil mein rehkar bhi sukoon nahi lene dete.</p>

  <p>Yahan kavita likhi nahi jaati, nikali jaati hai. Jo tum keh nahi paaye, shayad kisi aur ne likh diya ho.</p>

  <p>Kavi kehna chahte hain ki har dil mein ek kavita adhuri hai.</p>

